 Post-secondary education in hospitality management, catering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)
 Training-oriented profile with strong interpersonal skills and the ability to coach, support, and engage teams on the ground.
 Experience working in regional or remote labor camps (strong asset)
 Strong proficiency in spoken and written English
